========================================
Search mov <anything>, ebx for instance:

--- mov\s+.+\s*,\s*ebx ---

result:
mov dword [eax+0x1C], ebx
mov dword [esi], ebx
mov dword [esp+0x10], ebx
mov edx, ebx
....

if you want mov <reg>, eax:

mov\s+[a-zA-Z][a-zA-Z0-9]*\s*,\s*eax
xchg\s+[a-zA-Z][a-zA-Z0-9]*\s*,\s*eax
========================================
search for push eax ; <anything not pop> ; pop anything

push\s+eax\s*;(?:\s*[^;]+;)*\s*pop\s+[^;]+
========================================
search for return 0x<5 numbers>

retn\s+0x[0-9A-Fa-f]{5}\b 
